    {
      "id": "mm-s101112-criteria-targeting-q-8a09e01e",
      "type": "short",
      "stem": "Explain targeting and the basis for selecting segments.",
      "options": [],
      "answer": "",
      "accept": [],
      "explanation": "",
      "model_answer_md": "**Targeting** means evaluating the attractiveness of each market segment, selecting one or more segments, and designing marketing programmes accordingly.\n\nSegments are selected on **attractiveness, size and capability to serve** that segment. The slide also contrasts mass marketing with customized marketing.",
